226f430-9063-56c7-a03b-1f2aa7e4fc63" :question/math-academy-id "q-125668" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14060266/assets/6ed50407066da9fc213202ccff8c8be06c89d2dce0f5dfe07877cab77c98b3ec.png)\n\nConsider the ellipse $E$ and vector field $F$ shown above. Let $C$ be any path where $E$ is traversed once in the **clockwise** direction. Which of the following statements are true?\n\n- ${∮}_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0$\n- ${∮}_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0$\n- ${∮}_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=0$" :question/worked-solution "The circulation $Γ$ measures the total work done by a force $F$ in moving a particle along a *closed* curve $C.$\nIt is given by the formula\n\n$$\nΓ={∮}_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r={\\int }_{a}^{b}F(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe now recall the following:\n\n- If the force works *with* the motion of the particle (i.e., the force helps to push the particle along the path), then ${∮}_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0.$\n\n- If the force works *against* the motion of the particle (i.e., the force impedes the motion of the particle as it moves along the path), then ${∮}_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement.\n\n- Statements I and II are false. Since the force $F$ acts perpendicular to the motion of the particle as it moves around $C,$ it neither helps nor hinders its motion. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14060266/assets/045f6867a50dff0c162376015cc4651de796d0a637643b4b5ba402ef55dde4fa.png)\n\nSo, ${∮}_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=0.$\n\n- Statement III is true. If we reverse the orientation of $C,$ then the situation with regards to the work done by $F$ remains unchanged.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14060266/assets/698f68b9539e6ef5c4b07dbe6cf3859449e2687db19406f6c2b0072fa5eb697e.png)\n\nSo, ${∮}_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-125668/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6f30993e-b5c7-5d8a-9b27-2aed2c9223e1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-125668"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-125637/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "966eda17-e98c-5e7e-83d1-27fd53f33c1f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125637/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "9da4bdd0-a66f-5d5a-a627-e975532ccdbb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125637/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "a9ba3a68-5919-533c-8f4e-4b60f2b00432" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125637/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "6112e3b9-5d26-53cc-845a-9ad1d2b9df8e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125637/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "ddf22512-d76b-58d4-b0ea-f72d96932f7f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-125637/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9f002364-167f-58d8-b925-1d36fb2b102a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-125637/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer-field/choices ["q-125637/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-125637/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787